==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ru|lytdybr|sc=Latn}} {{qualifier|the Latin script spelling; used even within Cyrillic text}}

===Etymology===
Recyrillization of {{term/t|ru|lytdybr|sc=Latn}}, from the letters you would get when typing {{term|дневни́к||journal, diary|lang=ru}} using a Latin QWERTY keyboard layout instead of a Cyrillic one.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/lɨˈdːɨb(ə)r/|/lɨtˈdɨb(ə)r/|lang=ru}}

